e that falls across one eyebrow, a long face and high cheekbones, and a favorite piece of clothing, an unlined tan jacket. It usually goes with a replacement button a shade darker than the others. When somebody else has the floor, Barbara looks toward the door whenever a name is called.","personality":"Barbara enjoys routines and will defend the right of someone else to break one. As a result, Barbara is often everyone's favorite cover for a missed morning.","agenda":"To keep the dessert table welcome through closing.","family":"Gareth Mercer is Barbara’s half-sibling. Barbara leaves the first voice message. Gareth calls back when there is finally a little privacy. In their family a missed ring can mean a bus, a customer, a sleeping child or a bad hour. Neither treats it as an answer in itself. Asked about *The driving lesson fund*, Gareth says, “I am the student who got the lesson. My employer tried to take the credit and I quietly corrected the newsletter.”","connections":"Elizabeth Campos. Both tips and an affordable birthday cake depend on the dessert table being welcomed.","familyIds":["AH-R1316"],"connectionIds":["AH-R0978"],"reactions":[{"situation":"A waiter offers to split one birthday dessert among everybody","response":"Barbara checks that the birthday guest likes the dessert before calculating the portions.","asWritten":"A waiter offers to split one birthday dessert among everybody. Barbara checks that the birthday guest likes the dessert before calculating the portions."},{"situation":"A family supper turns into an argument about old debt","response":"Barbara clears the dishes, lets the angriest speaker cool off, and resumes the conversation with a smaller audience.","asWritten":"A family supper turns into an argument about old debt. Barbara clears the dishes, lets the angriest speaker cool off, and resumes the conversation with a smaller audience."},{"situation":"If a family plan changes at the door","response":"Barbara keeps a place for the late person without making the others postpone their meal.","asWritten":"If a family plan changes at the door, Barbara keeps a place for the late person without making the others postpone their meal."}]},"appearanceSource":"biography casting design"}},{"mesh":6,"name":"Hair_bob02","skin":0},{"mesh":7,"name":"Cloth_jacket","skin":0},{"mesh":8,"name":"Cloth_tshirt","skin":0},{"mesh":9,"name":"Cloth_jeans","skin":0},{"mesh":10,"name":"Cloth_boots","skin":0}],"meshes":[{"name":"base","extras":{"targetNames":["gender_female","weight_max","muscle_max","height_tall","face_nose_width_decr","face_nose_length_incr","face_nose_height_decr","face_jaw_width_incr","face_chin_incr","face_cheekbones_decr","face_eye_size_decr","face_eye_spacing_decr","face_eye_tilt_incr","face_lips_decr","face_mouth_width_decr","face_ear_size_incr","face_forehead_decr","blink_left","blink_right","corr_weight_max__muscle_max","corr_gender_female__muscle_max","corr_gender_female__weight_max"]},"weights":[0.5571,0.1763,0.1432,0.1128,0.1446,0.1796,0.0204,0.2906,0.4152,0.2988,0.2405,0.496,0.5284,0.4242,0.0887,0.5094,0.2164,0,0,0.02525,0.07978,0.09822],"primitives":[{"attributes":{"POSITION":2,"NORMAL":3,"TEXCOORD_0":4,"JOINTS_0":5,"WEIGHTS_0":6},"indices":1,"material":0,"targets":[{"POSITION":7,"NORMAL":8},{"POSITION":9,"NORMAL":10},{"POSITION":11,"NORMAL":12},{"POSITION":13,"NORMAL":14},{"POSITION":15,"NORMAL":16},{"POSITION":17,"NORMAL":18},{"POSITION":19,"NORMAL":20},{"POSITION":21,"NORMAL":22},{"POSITION":23,"NORMAL":24},{"POSITION":25,"NORMAL":26},{"POSITION":27,"NORMAL":28},{"POSITION":29,"NORMAL":30},{"POSITION":31,"NORMAL":32},{"POSITION":33,"NORMAL":34},{"POSITION":35,"NORMAL":36},{"POSITION":37,"NORMAL":38},{"POSITION":39,"NORMAL":40},{"POSITION":41,"NORMAL":42},{"POSITION":43,"NORMAL":44},{"POSITION":45,"NORMAL":46},{"POSITION":47,"NORMAL":48},{"POSITION":49,"NORMAL":50}]}]},{"name":"Eyebrows","extras":{"targetNames":["gender_female","weight_max","muscle_max","height_tall","face_nose_width_decr","face_n